{"id":"n83671-1-8","stage":4,"title":"폭죽 · 鞭炮","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83671-1-8-1","ko":"어디선가 폭죽 소리가 들리는데?","zh":"好像哪儿有烟花的声音？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디선가","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디선가","audio":"/audio/c4b34d57fc12e5f65129.mp3"}},{"text":"폭죽","meaning":"鞭炮，爆竹，烟花","explanation":"폭죽：鞭炮，爆竹，烟花。","readings":[{"term":"폭죽","audio":"/audio/f303e55de09e72561f9c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83671","senseId":"1","lemma":"폭죽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"폭죽","audio":"/audio/f303e55de09e72561f9c.mp3"}},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리가","audio":"/audio/0c12216fc63402c5db52.mp3"}},{"text":"들리는데?","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들리는데","audio":"/audio/89ab9ad953fd1924db52.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"f303e55de09e7256","term":"폭죽","zh":"鞭炮，爆竹，烟花","audio":"/audio/f303e55de09e72561f9c.mp3","entryId":"83671","definition":"在细长的筒内放入火药点燃后，使发出爆炸声或迸裂出火花的东西。","pronunciation":["폭쭉"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/78e5202c091696cfebca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83671-1-8-2","ko":"오늘 대학교 축제가 있다나 봐.","zh":"听说今天学校有节日庆典呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"대학교","meaning":"大学","explanation":"대학교：大学。","readings":[{"term":"대학교","audio":"/audio/a6ed069da2b0f3998868.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66319","senseId":"1","lemma":"대학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대학교","audio":"/audio/a6ed069da2b0f3998868.mp3"}},{"text":"축제가","meaning":"庆典","explanation":"축제：庆典；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"축제","audio":"/audio/0bf538f6ba0e7895d423.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72136","senseId":"1","lemma":"축제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축제가","audio":"/audio/7a48f57b38268230cb25.mp3"}},{"text":"있다나","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；다나：以不十分确定或不太关心的口吻转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있다나","audio":"/audio/138f338024a1dbd0996c.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看样子，看来","explanation":"보다：看样子，看来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"a6ed069da2b0f399","term":"대학교","zh":"大学","audio":"/audio/a6ed069da2b0f3998868.mp3","entryId":"66319","definition":"高中毕业后晋升的学校教育的最后一个阶段，是最高教育机构；或指那种机构所在的建筑物和设施。","pronunciation":["대ː학꾜"]},{"id":"0bf538f6ba0e7895","term":"축제","zh":"庆典","audio":"/audio/0bf538f6ba0e7895d423.mp3","entryId":"72136","definition":"为纪念或祝贺某事而举行的大规模仪式。","pronunciation":["축쩨"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看样子，看来","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"由前面的话语所指的行动或状态来推算或表示即使不正确但知道。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d7dedfd57531dc48f025.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.633,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83671","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说今天学校有节日庆典呢。","教育差距能只用个人努力来解释吗？","好像哪儿有烟花的声音？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说今天学校有节日庆典呢。","好像哪儿有烟花的声音？","教育差距能只用个人努力来解释吗？"],"answer":0}]}
